scription-module__T5pcGa__wrapper"><p data-cy="document-description">The document discusses the movements of the Earth, including its rotation on its axis and revolution around the sun. It notes that the Earth's rotation causes day and night and its elliptical revolution around the sun takes 365 days. It also describes how the tilt of the Earth's axis and its revolution cause seasons, with the northern and southern hemispheres experiencing opposite seasons at the same time. Summer occurs when a hemisphere is tilted toward the sun, and winter when it is tilted away.</p><!--&--><div class="CategoryLinks-module__FTe7aG__root"><a class="link link-module__Gim9xG__root link-module__Gim9xG__primary weight-medium link-module__Gim9xG__medium link-module__Gim9xG__underline" aria-label="View the featured presentations, documents and infographics in the Education Category" href="https://www.slideshare.net/category/education">Education</a><span class="text Text-module__DjdFRa__root weight-regular Text-module__DjdFRa__medium">â—¦</span></div><!--/&--></div><!--&--><button type="button" class="button Button-module__4HgN-q__root Button-module__4HgN-q__primary Button-module__4HgN-q__text Button-module__4HgN-q__medium Description-module__T5pcGa__readMore" aria-label="Read more" data-cy="read-more-button"><span><span class="Button-module__4HgN-q__spinnerSlide"><svg class="spinner" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 50 50" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" data-dd-excluded-activity-mutations="true"><path d="M43.935,25.145c0-10.318-8.364-18.683-18.683-18.683c-10.318,0-18.683,8.365-18.683,18.683h4.068c0-8.071,6.543-14.615,14.615-14.615c8.072,0,14.615,6.543,14.615,14.615H43.935z"><animateTransform attributeType="xml" attributeName="transform" type="rotate" from="0 25 25" to="360 25 25" dur="0.6s" repeatCount="indefinite"></animateTransform></path></svg></span><span class="ellipsis"><span class="Description-module__T5pcGa__readMoreLabel">Read more</span></span></span>